                                "sense_id": "211065b1-37a2-317a-ae9c-d15b03620156",
                                "text": "I've been to hell. I spell it...I spell it DMV\nAnyone that's been there knows precisely what I mean\nI've stood in line and waited near an hour and fifteen"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5d17502-39db-47a3-a712-279fdfb11082",
                                "sense_id": "211065b1-37a2-317a-ae9c-d15b03620156",
                                "text": "Girlie, as far as you're concerned, I'm the messiah of the DMV. Now, get out of the car."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7b88870-10d8-4cbe-a0f0-7404f6d1dc91",
                                "sense_id": "211065b1-37a2-317a-ae9c-d15b03620156",
                                "text": "The state is currently in the 9EWZ000-9EWZ999 series, and the final plate in the current sequence — 9ZZZ999 — is expected to be issued in late 2025, DMV officials said."
                            }
